# Rebellious Captives: "Exhaust - {6}: Put two +1/+1 counters on this creature, then earthbend 2." The ability costs exactly {6}: five
# Moxen are short, the sixth source (a Forest) pays it; only a land Bot1 controls can be the target (Bot2's Island is refused). The Captives
# becomes a 4/4 and the second Forest a 2/2 land creature with haste (two +1/+1 counters on a 0/0, CR 701.66a). Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills
# the land in turn 4 and the delayed return puts it back onto the battlefield tapped, a plain land again; in turn 5 the exhaust ability
# cannot be activated a second time with seven sources untapped (CR 702.177a).

